From bd939087daeba1b9d42afe03dd89f4566dfb678c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:02:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] feat(auto-reply): plumb toolCallId, dedupe final
 payloads, and harden session dispatch

- Plumb toolCallId through onToolStart and ReplyPayload
- Dedupe equivalent final payloads in dispatch-from-config
- Use runModelAwareAgent in memory flush and followup runner
- Expose replyToId in message_sending hook metadata
- Harden abort handling and session hooks context
- Add message-received hooks pipeline
- Improve streaming directives and session usage tracking

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
